==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hatsune Miku (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[MikuGory|MikuGories]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

